OL,3,GNEWSABoardmasters survey shows mixed
OL,4,Aimpact on businesses
OL,5,
OL,6,FA survey looking at the impact of a
OL,7,Fmusic festival on local businesses has
OL,8,Frevealed a "mixed picture", organisers
OL,9,Fhave said.
OL,11,FThe Boardmasters surf and music event
OL,12,Fhas become one of the country's biggest
OL,13,Ffestivals, with a cumulative 158,000
OL,14,Fsurf and music fans attending the event
OL,15,Fin and around Newquay, Cornwall, over
OL,16,Ffive days in August.
OL,18,FThe Newquay Business Improvement
OL,19,FDistrict (BID) group said it welcomed
OL,20,Fthe first feedback from businesses
OL,21,Fafter launching its Beyond Boardmasters
OL,22,Fcampaign.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
