OL,3,GNEWSABoardmasters survey shows mixed
OL,4,Aimpact on businesses
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said some businesses reported growth
OL,7,Fof more than 20% during the week, while
OL,8,Fothers reported lesser increases, and
OL,9,Fothers recorded falls of varying
OL,10,Famounts, some of more than 20%.
